{"agent":"fx-roborev-guards","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":4,"detail":"The scenario in the bug (B256be593f0) is a fix task that was already CLAIMED when its fix landed elsewhere, so `--landed` must end the caller’s own claimed task. `_landed_elsewhere` deliberately builds an \"UNCLAIMED\" task and never runs `claim` as the closing agent; the only claimed test (`test_a_task_held_by_someone_else_is_kept`) claims as `--agent other` and asserts the task is kept, not ended. As a result, an implementation that still fails for a self-claimed task—the exact bug being fixed—would leave this suite green while the bug remains.","digest":"5a77cbb20ed1ceb8","location":"tests/test_bug_fixed_landed.py:23-25/_landed_elsewhere","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_bug_fixed_landed.py:23-25/_landed_elsewhere"}],"chunks_total":4,"coverage":"4/4 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":17717,"diff_sha":"ce8270ddd9952ea30853977145cbd8fae2992f6cfded31c34dd6e0ab6a988f8b","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":885.6,"excluded_bytes":3542,"excluded_files":3,"excluded_paths":["README.md","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_cli_help.ambr","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_mcp_tools.ambr"],"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"6ebacb19fb5e9313","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B256be593f0.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261021T184157Z-c25d2289.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4],"reviewed_head":"ff9e76bd6492531eebe11ca9a2386c38bbafecfa","reviewed_paths":{"README.md":"100644 67e6fa59f10971e7c2872fc7254d059ebc29c48c","ddflow/api/knowledge/bug_close.py":"100644 cc4094ce30a55bd5581d84e2494b82b53487c8ce","ddflow/surfaces/commands/knowledge.py":"100644 66b4d27c9f4eb1e1f56765828661b